msgid "Automatically, when a file changes — recommended"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-prevent-browser-caching-admin-settings.php:172
msgid "Browser caching keeps working at full strength; files are re-downloaded only after they really change."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-prevent-browser-caching-admin-settings.php:176
